<title>USA: First of America Securities opens Chicago office.</title>
<headline>First of America Securities opens Chicago office.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of America Securities Inc in Kalamazoo, Mich., said it has opened a Chicago office.</p>
<p>First of America Securities Inc</p>
<p>10 South La Salle St.</p>
<p>Suite 1060</p>
<p>Chicago, Ill., 60603</p>
<p>Phone: 312-214-5430</p>
<p>Fax: 312-214-5403</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
